{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport secrets,json,pathlib\nnames=['Whee Fit','We Fit In','Wee Bit Fit','Oui Fit','Wobbly Fit','Tea Fit','Nearly Fit','Wee Shift','We Sit','Wii-ish Wishes','Whee Balance','Wee Sway','Please Sit','Wee Still','We Fit Eventually','Sea Fit','Me Fit Maybe','Tree Fit','Wee Dip','Wee Knit','Wee Lift','We Fit Politely','Wee Wobble','Wee Breathe','We Sway','Whee Retreat','Wii Little Rest','We Fit For Tea','Wee Tilt','Wee Repose','We Lean In','Slightly Fit','Wee Stand','Wee Float','We Fit-ish','Wee Stretch','Wee Stork','Whee Calm','We Fit Tomorrow','Wee Unsteady','Wee Posture','Wee Balance','Wee Serene','Wee Exhale','Whee Hips','Wee Gentle','Wee Routine','Wee Nudge','Wee Resolve','Wee Trip']\ni=secrets.randbelow(50);title=names[i];slug=title.replace(' ','-');name=f'{slug}-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-220355';p=pathlib.Path(name);p.mkdir();(p/'title-selection.json').write_text(json.dumps({'title':title,'index':i,'candidates':50,'method':'Python secrets.randbelow(50)'},indent=2));print(json.dumps({'title':title,'folder':name}));pathlib.Path('PROGRESS.md').write_text('# Progress\\\\n\\\\n## Requirements and decisions\\\\n- Read TASK.md and initial PLAN.md sections; building solo.\\\\n- Title randomly selected from 50 privately brainstormed candidates using Python secrets: '+title+'.\\\\n- Dev folder: \"'`'\"'+name+'\"'`; root deliverable: `'\"'+name+'.html\"'`.'\"\\\\n- Root \"'`exit-interview.json` must match TASK.md and be embedded in About.'\"\\\\n- Build on handoff engine; all audio procedural, music 10%; five-day retreat, twelve activities, Class, hub, attract, developer tools.\\\\n- Test one browser at a time; file:// except hub harness. Use phone, tablet, ultrawide and WebKit checks. Toolkit guide is missing; installed commands can still be used.\\\\n\\\\n## Status\\\\n- M0 starting: fetching engine and hub; reading remaining plan.\\\\n\\\\n## Next steps\\\\n1. Fetch dependencies and inspect engine API.\\\\n2. Build Lean and session wrapper; implement visual style and title.\\\\n3. Build day flow, activities, multiplayer, tools, audio.\\\\n4. Run automated playthrough, browser/device checks, hub harness.\\\\n5. Final bundle, About/exit interview, handoff.\\\\n')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
