teps\\\\n1. Fetch dependencies and inspect engine API.\\\\n2. Build Lean and session wrapper; implement visual style and title.\\\\n3. Build day flow, activities, multiplayer, tools, audio.\\\\n4. Run automated playthrough, browser/device checks, hub harness.\\\\n5. Final bundle, About/exit interview, handoff.\\\\n')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\"title\": \"Wee Serene\", \"folder\": \"Wee-Serene-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-220355\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
