 tier.\n4. Gameplay: Tier 2 rail durations did not allow the planned rep counts. Added designer-owned durations for 12/10/12 reps.\nEOF\nnode build.mjs\nnode --input-type=module - <<'JS'\nimport {load} from './tests/load.mjs';const {G}=load();G.animateContestant=()=>{};for(const tier of [1,2]){for(const skill of ['passive','average','good','expert']){let scores=[];for(let seed=1;seed<=12;seed++){const ctx=G.makeContext('laundry',tier,{seed});for(let i=0;i<100*120&&\"'!ctx.done;i++)G.stepContext(ctx,1/120,skill);scores.push(ctx.a.result(ctx,ctx.contestants[0]).pct);}console.log('\"'laundry',tier,skill,'min',Math.min(...scores).toFixed(2),'mean',(scores.reduce((a,b)=>a+b)/12).toFixed(2));}}\nJS\"","aggregated_output":"Wee-Serene-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-220355.html · 1610 KB\nlaundry 1 passive min 0.00 mean 0.00\nlaundry 1 average min 0.30 mean 0.65\nlaundry 1 good min 1.00 mean 1.00\nlaundry 1 expert min 1.00 mean 1.00\nlaundry 2 passive min 0.00 mean 0.00\nlaundry 2 average min 0.00 mean 0.36\nlaundry 2 good min 0.49 mean 0.95\nlaundry 2 expert min 1.00 mean 1.00\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_55","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n# Wee Serene — progress\n\n## Requirements and decisions\n- TASK.md and all of PLAN.md read. Build solo; no subagents.\n- Random title selection: **Wee Serene**, chosen with Python \"'`secrets.randbelow(50)` from 50 candidates (selection record in dev folder).\n- Dev folder: `Wee-Serene-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-220355`.\n- Root deliverable: `Wee-Serene-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-220355.html`.\n- Root `exit-interview.json` still needs final answers; build injects it into `G.ABOUT` when present.\n- Engine fetched: my-3D2dge **v0.89.0** (plan used .88). Hub client 1.4.0, unmodified first head script.\n- Engine patch: three Dialog text shadows are configurable, as plan requested. All other changes are game code.\n- All visual/audio assets code-native. 23 bundled motion clips, procedural songs, SFX and voices. Music defaults .1.\n\n## Implemented\n- Core state, save slots, input intents, Lean physics, delayed bots, Plate, Gentle Mode.\n- Original Tare, Gerald, wooden instructor joints, mats, exercise props, island buildings and flora.\n- All 12 activities with both tiers: Stork, Flow, Candle, Squat, Push-Up, Lunge, Step, Hoop, Jog, Slalom, Tray, Laundry.\n- Title, members/customization, arrival/instructors, bungalow/wardrobe, Body Check, island + click walking, catalogue, session wrapper/card/countdown/results/retry, evening/day cycle, Tare'\"'s recalibration, Gentle Games/duel, ending/credits/Free Play.\n- Class lobby, split keyboard and pad joining, bots, scores/podium, three-round surprise.\n- Hub own card, seeded event deal/timing, ghosts/progress/results/end handling.\n- Attract playlist covers island, Body Check, all activities, class/results/duel; live dev dock with sliders/jumps/bot/freeze/pose tools.\n- About paging and self-contained build script. Built file currently ~1.6 MB.\n\n## Testing and issues\n- Initial Chromium screenshot inspected: title looks coherent, large pixels, bright studio.\n- Browser smoke visited members/customize/bungalow/bodycheck/island/catalog/games/classLobby/pose without draw errors.\n- Pure simulations: Stork1 passive0, average .67, good .94; Stork2 good .46, expert .75. Most other activities meet target bands.\n- Critical bugs found/fixed: clip objects required by Mocap; undefined session options overwrote contestants/duration.\n- Gameplay fixes: second-tier rail duration now supports full rep counts; Laundry default instability 12, gust4.5 (was16/9); second tier +2.\n- \"'`tests/issues.md` tracks discovered/fixed issues for exit-interview counts.\n- Laundry 12-seed sweep is currently running in exec session **20904**; poll it.\n- `tests/load.mjs` is a VM loader, but formal `tests/run.mjs` runner still needs to be written.\n- Browser screenshots so far in dev `tests/`: title-first.png, island-first.png, card-first.png, session-first.png. Only title viewed yet. Session screenshots before option fix are invalid; recapture.\n\n## Commands and testing constraints\n- Build from dev folder: `node build.mjs` writes root HTML and `tests/hub/game.html`, also dev `game/index.html` and scripts.json.\n- Node Playwright 1.63.0 installed locally. Browsers already installed; do not install them/deps.\n- Use file:// for standalone. Bind a self-owned ephemeral 127.0.0.1 server for hub harness; stop only your server PID.\n- Keep 1 browser at a time. Phone/tablet/ultrawide/WebKit/Firefox checks still required. `~/dev/TESTING-TOOLKIT.md` absent; viewport-matrix may not exist; own Playwright matrix is fine.\n- No physical pad, iOS Safari, second person or human audio judgement. Use stand-ins and report limits honestly.\n\n## Next steps\n1. Poll Laundry sweep; ensure tier 1 average≥1★ and good≥2★, tier2 good≥1★ expert≥2★. Tune based on evidence if needed.\n2. Formal rules runner: models/activities (multiple seeds), full real-input story (good and passive), saves/isolation, attract boundary/coverage/no mutations, dev tools, Class, hub fake clock, data lint.\n3. Browser play/screenshot each activity and main screens; fix layout, prompts and errors. Inspect existing island screenshot now.\n4. Validate controller stand-in, mouse/keyboard, WebAudio buffers/analyser/voices, touch notice and 14-viewports cross-engine screenshots.\n5. Run hub harness 1/2/3/4 + bad network + host leave, plus two-page ghost traffic.\n6. Write README and root exit-interview JSON, embed it, rerun affected tests. Final root deliverables + progress complete.\n\n## Known concerns to inspect\n- Title'\"'s left plant is behind subtitle; may remove that prop on title for clarity.\n- G.readIntent dev keyboard path uses \"'`I.keys?.has`; verify actual engine key storage, so WASD keeps leaning while arrows adjust sliders.\n- Split keyboard action prompts and class input restoration need real tests.\n- Time scale 0 cannot be restored via scene update, but dev update runs input hook; verify reset updates game.timeScale.\n- Hub report total must not double-count finished event. Protocol harness not run yet.\n- About attract can start after 10 s; long reading should probably reset idle on page navigation (input hook already does).\n- `G.record` does not bank Class minutes (intended no member mutation) but free play banks progress.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
