ttract boundary/coverage/no mutations, dev tools, Class, hub fake clock, data lint.\n3. Browser play/screenshot each activity and main screens; fix layout, prompts and errors. Inspect existing island screenshot now.\n4. Validate controller stand-in, mouse/keyboard, WebAudio buffers/analyser/voices, touch notice and 14-viewports cross-engine screenshots.\n5. Run hub harness 1/2/3/4 + bad network + host leave, plus two-page ghost traffic.\n6. Write README and root exit-interview JSON, embed it, rerun affected tests. Final root deliverables + progress complete.\n\n## Known concerns to inspect\n- Title'\"'s left plant is behind subtitle; may remove that prop on title for clarity.\n- G.readIntent dev keyboard path uses \"'`I.keys?.has`; verify actual engine key storage, so WASD keeps leaning while arrows adjust sliders.\n- Split keyboard action prompts and class input restoration need real tests.\n- Time scale 0 cannot be restored via scene update, but dev update runs input hook; verify reset updates game.timeScale.\n- Hub report total must not double-count finished event. Protocol harness not run yet.\n- About attract can start after 10 s; long reading should probably reset idle on page navigation (input hook already does).\n- `G.record` does not bank Class minutes (intended no member mutation) but free play banks progress.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
