{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_87","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat tests/test-progress.json tests/rules-progress.json && rg -n 'FAIL|Critical|Visual|Input|Balance' tests/issues.md\"","aggregated_output":"{\"group\":\"attract and developer tools\",\"at\":\"2026-11-05T05:49:04.909Z\"}{\"story\":\"passive\",\"day\":5,\"step\":\"candle\",\"at\":\"2026-11-05T05:49:01.076Z\"}3:1. Critical: Mocap sampling requires a clip object, not a clip name. Fixed the rig adapter.\n4:2. Critical: Session options containing undefined fields replaced the contestants array and default duration. Filtered optional fields before constructing the context.\n8:5. Visual/gameplay: Road and Mode 7 overlays hid the player rigs. Drew the rigs in the overlay pass after the course.\n10:7. Input: The developer dock read a nonexistent key set. Corrected it to the engine's held-key set.\n11:8. Critical: Idle detection treated anyPressed as a property instead of calling it, preventing attract mode from starting. Corrected both input checks.\n12:9. Balance: Single-sine bot noise missed the plan's Candle benchmark. Used the specified seeded smooth-noise generator for bot errors.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
