{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_95","type":"agent_message","text":"The combined suite passed all 774 checks. An additional control check found that WASD could move the developer panel’s selection while also leaning. I’m separating those bindings so arrows operate the tools and WASD keeps controlling the activity, including during shared-keyboard Class play.\n"}}
